Overlay patch 0002: TorchExternal builds only the factories this game needs.
The standalone torch (ExternalProject, used by ExtractAssets/GenerateO2R) is a
fresh CMake invocation, so torch's own defaults apply and it compiles SM64/
SF64/F-Zero/Mario-Artist factories the kart build never uses — and the SM64
ones don't compile against fmt 11 (scoped-enum SPDLOG_INFO args at
BehaviorScriptFactory.cpp:188, GeoLayoutFactory.cpp:331,
LevelScriptFactory.cpp:209). Mirror the parent's game flags (MK64 on,
everything else off) into the ExternalProject CMAKE_ARGS. Upstreamable to
HarbourMasters/SpaghettiKart.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -708,6 +708,8 @@
     PREFIX TorchExternal
     SOURCE_DIR ${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/torch
     CMAKE_ARGS -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/torch
+               -DBUILD_SM64=OFF -DBUILD_SF64=OFF -DBUILD_FZERO=OFF
+               -DBUILD_MARIO_ARTIST=OFF # match the parent's game flags
 )
 
   ExternalProject_Get_Property(TorchExternal install_dir)
